---
title: Pagy customization
label: Pagination
---

To add styles to pagy's helpers, you can add the following to your styles:

```
.pagy {
  @apply isolate inline-flex -space-x-px rounded-md shadow;

  .gap {
    @apply relative inline-flex items-center px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 ring-1 ring-gray-300 ring-inset;

    &:focus {
      @apply outline-offset-0;
    }
  }

  a:not(.gap) {
    @apply relative inline-flex items-center px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 ring-1 ring-gray-300 ring-inset;
    &:hover {
      @apply bg-gray-50;
    }
    &:focus {
      @apply z-20 outline-offset-0;
    }
    &:not([href]) {
      /* disabled links */
      @apply text-gray-300 bg-gray-100 cursor-default;
    }
    &.current {
      @apply z-10 bg-indigo-600 text-white ring-indigo-600;

      &:focus-visible {
        @apply outline-2 outline-offset-2 outline-indigo-600;
      }
    }
    &:first-child {
      @apply rounded-l-md px-3 py-2 text-gray-400;
    }
    &:last-child {
      @apply rounded-r-md px-3 py-2 text-gray-400;
    }
  }
}
```
